# The Skeleton Case of the Stashed Skeleton suspects has menace and "This creature can't block" while it is suspected (CR
# 701.60c). On turn 4 Bot2 attacks with Llanowar Elves: the Skeleton may not block them, while Bot1's Ornithopter may (the
# positive control). On turn 5 the Skeleton attacks: one Ornithopter alone may not block it (menace, CR 702.110b), two together
# may. The Skeleton deals its 2 damage to the first blocker, which dies, and the 0-power Ornithopters deal none back.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Case of the Stashed Skeleton
Ornithopter
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
! Bot1.Block(Skeleton Token > Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter > Llanowar Elves)
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Skeleton Token > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Skeleton Token)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter#1 > Skeleton Token; Ornithopter#2 > Skeleton Token)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Suspected = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Case of the Stashed Skeleton; Mox Jet; Ornithopter; Skeleton Token; Swamp
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Llanowar Elves; Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Keywords = CantBlock; Menace
